From 008c96260972f224a3bd69971d2dcb4dcde5f808 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:52:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(examples): add the catalog case 3d/rough-finish

A small domed part: a 3D Pocket roughs it, then two 3D Finish
operations (Parallel and Waterline) with a 6 mm ball finish it. The
case regenerates, verifies clean and posts its pinned program within
the 60 s debug budget. The 3D Pocket and 3D Finish guide sections now
link the case (generated blocks).

Fixes #2866

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
